# Normalisation des fins de ligne.
#
# The install scripts and the Docker entrypoints are run by bash under Linux:
# a CRLF there produces an unreadable error (`/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter`).
# So LF is forced everywhere, Windows workstations included.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh    text eol=lf
*.bash  text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary

